ARM: imx6ul: find the ocotp node on i.MX6ULL

The i.MX6ULL ocotp node is "fsl,imx6ull-ocotp": the MAC init did not
find it and warned "failed to find ocotp node".

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
--- a/arch/arm/mach-imx/mach-imx6ul.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-imx/mach-imx6ul.c
@@ -16,7 +16,8 @@
 		imx_get_soc_revision());
 
 	of_platform_default_populate(NULL, NULL, NULL);
-	imx6_enet_mac_init("fsl,imx6ul-fec", "fsl,imx6ul-ocotp");
+	imx6_enet_mac_init("fsl,imx6ul-fec", cpu_is_imx6ull() ?
+			   "fsl,imx6ull-ocotp" : "fsl,imx6ul-ocotp");
 	imx_anatop_init();
 	imx6ul_pm_init();
 }
